<title>USA: EQUISURE TO BUY BACK UP TO 250,000 SHARES.</title>
<headline>EQUISURE TO BUY BACK UP TO 250,000 SHARES.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equisure Inc said it approved the repurchase of up to 250,000 shares of its common stock on the open market.</p>
<p>The shares will be held by the company as treasury stock, the insurer said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787)) Monday, 23 June 1997 22:23:18 ENDS  nN2365492</p>
